{"id":"wb-4-182","name":"东坡书院","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"东坡书院","text":"东坡书院位于中国海南省儋州市中和镇东郊，为苏轼故居遗址。明清时期改建。文化大革命时期被毁，文物荡然无存，1982年其重建。\n东坡书院包括载酒亭、载酒堂、耳房、廊舍和奥堂龛等古迹。现已经辟为陈列馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%9C%E5%9D%A1%E4%B9%A6%E9%99%A2","revisionId":93801105,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93801105","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/90ba49166e5081a6d2d43d98.jpg","title":"Entrance_of_Dongpo_Academy,_Danzhou_(20230327163531).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Entrance_of_Dongpo_Academy,_Danzhou_(20230327163531).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/26/Entrance_of_Dongpo_Academy%2C_Danzhou_%2820230327163531%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"N509FZ","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Su Shi was relegated to Danzhou in 1097.","width":320,"height":213}}